WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.894
Vinnie and Mandy followed Gildong to the nobleman's house.

2
00:00:05.895 --> 00:00:09.285
He led them through a busy street.

3
00:00:09.286 --> 00:00:13.909
Suddenly Mandy noticed something strange.

4
00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:19.256
"Why are so many people wearing white?" she asked.

5
00:00:19.257 --> 00:00:21.672
Gildong laughed.

6
00:00:21.673 --> 00:00:26.242
"You must be from very far away," he said.

7
00:00:26.243 --> 00:00:30.029
"In Korea poor people usually wear white.

8
00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:33.508
Only nobles and royalty can wear colors."

9
00:00:33.509 --> 00:00:40.122
"So that's where we are!" thought Mandy. "Korea!"

10
00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:44.251
Soon the children reached a large house.

11
00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:48.173
In the courtyard people looked very busy.

12
00:00:48.174 --> 00:00:52.826
"They are getting ready for a special ceremony," said Gildong.

13
00:00:52.827 --> 00:00:58.501
Vinnie watched a woman pounding something with a thick stick.

14
00:00:58.502 --> 00:01:02.306
"She's pounding rice," explained Gildong.

15
00:01:02.307 --> 00:01:06.511
The children saw a room with a big table.

16
00:01:06.512 --> 00:01:09.781
A girl was placing food there.

17
00:01:09.782 --> 00:01:13.508
"I'm hungry," Mandy said.

18
00:01:13.509 --> 00:01:18.280
"Sorry, but the food is for the ceremony," said Gildong.

19
00:01:18.281 --> 00:01:22.125
"Tonight they are remembering the nobleman's grandfather.

20
00:01:22.126 --> 00:01:25.661
He died on this day many years ago."

21
00:01:25.662 --> 00:01:29.383
"I don't understand," said Mandy.

22
00:01:29.384 --> 00:01:33.580
"Why are they making food for someone who died?"

23
00:01:33.581 --> 00:01:40.095
"The family honors their grandfather by offering wine and food," said Gildong.

24
00:01:40.096 --> 00:01:42.095
Mandy nodded.

25
00:01:42.096 --> 00:01:46.985
Vinnie asked where the food would go after the ceremony.

26
00:01:46.986 --> 00:01:52.132
"The nobleman's family will share it with others," Gildong said.

27
00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:55.487
"That's an important part of the ceremony."

28
00:01:55.488 --> 00:01:58.745
"Gildong!" a voice shouted.

29
00:01:58.746 --> 00:02:03.534
The children turned to see an old woman waving at

30
00:02:03.535 --> 00:02:07.045
them. "Finally!" she said to

31
00:02:07.046 --> 00:02:09.683
Gildong. "You have come with the

32
00:02:09.684 --> 00:02:14.367
bowls! We are thankful your father could make these for

33
00:02:14.368 --> 00:02:19.732
us." Gildong unwrapped the basket and gave the bowls to the

34
00:02:19.733 --> 00:02:23.142
woman. "May I look at one?" asked

35
00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:26.886
Mandy. "Yes." The woman handed one to

36
00:02:26.887 --> 00:02:30.856
her. "It's so smooth," Mandy

37
00:02:30.857 --> 00:02:36.682
said. "One day I will make bowls like that too," said Gildong

38
00:02:36.683 --> 00:02:41.222
proudly. The woman thanked the children for bringing the

39
00:02:41.223 --> 00:02:45.891
bowls."You must have a snack before you leave," she said.

40
00:02:45.892 --> 00:02:48.672
"Have a seat and wait here.

41
00:02:48.673 --> 00:02:52.625
I will be back in a few minutes."

42
00:02:52.626 --> 00:02:55.005
The woman soon returned.

43
00:02:55.006 --> 00:02:58.938
She was carrying a tray of snacks for the children.

44
00:02:58.939 --> 00:03:02.740
"Mmm . . . These are so sweet!

45
00:03:02.741 --> 00:03:04.391
What are they?"

46
00:03:04.639 --> 00:03:08.314
Mandy asked, chewing on an orange fruit.

47
00:03:08.315 --> 00:03:11.811
"They are dried persimmons," Gildong answered.

48
00:03:11.812 --> 00:03:14.821
"And these are rice cakes."

49
00:03:14.822 --> 00:03:19.480
He popped a soft white rice cake into his mouth.

50
00:03:19.481 --> 00:03:24.685
When they were finished, Gildong stood and bowed to the woman.

51
00:03:24.686 --> 00:03:27.513
"Thank you," he said.

52
00:03:27.514 --> 00:03:31.279
Vinnie and Mandy hopped up too and bowed.

53
00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:36.032
"Thank you!" they said. "Good-bye!"

54
00:03:36.033 --> 00:03:38.908
The children left the house.

55
00:03:38.909 --> 00:03:41.813
Suddenly Gildong stopped.

56
00:03:41.814 --> 00:03:46.912
"Hmm," he said. "Do you hear something?"

57
00:03:46.913 --> 00:03:49.450
Mandy's face lit up.

58
00:03:49.451 --> 00:03:58.182
"Yes!" she said. "I hear music!"

